  "summary": "Malicious code in @ornikar/lerna-config (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases and executes a 727KB obfuscated Bun-compiled bundle (math_init.js) at install time. The package is a trojanized version of the legitimate @ornikar/lerna-config monorepo tooling — the original lerna-config source files are present but the preinstall hook runs before any of them are loaded. The opaque binary payload cannot be statically verified; its execution is triggered automatically on npm install.",
